<title>ISRAEL: Israel's Elite 3Q net 8.67 mln shekels.</title>
<headline>Israel's Elite 3Q net 8.67 mln shekels.</headline>
<dateline>TEL AVIV 1996-12-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Israel's Elite Industries Ltd reported the following results to the Tel Aviv Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>				  (in thousands of shekels)</p>
<p>			   Q3 96     Q3 95     9-MTH 96    9-MTH 95</p>
<p>Revenue		  498,154   580,271   1,518,120   1,852,500</p>
<p>Operating profit	25,281    19,830	68,548	69,679</p>
<p>Net Profit		 8,672    14,277	31,194	44,575</p>
<p>($1 = 3.25 shekels)</p>
<p>-Tel Aviv newsroom, 972-3-537-2211</p>
</text>
